	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "KOGUMA MK4 encoder board for tire 24mm (6.0x8.75x0.6): 7 pads x 2 rows on the BACK (B, toward the main board), pitch 0.8, upper row 0.5x1.6mm at 0.9-2.5mm and lower row 0.5x1.0mm at 3.5-4.5mm from the top edge (main board top face at 2.7mm, bottom face at 3.3mm; no copper between, so solder does not flow into the gap): can be soldered to the main board on its top face, its bottom face, or both. Same-numbered pads are joined by masked tracks. Order seen from the chip side, left to right: 6 CS, 5 SCK, 4 MOSI, 3 MISO, 2 CAL, 7 GND, 1 3V3. Magnet axis at 4.9mm from the top edge")
